# Codegraph first (local intelligence)

Librarian keeps a gitignored [`.codegraph/`](../../.codegraph/) index. On major work
(router splits, new packages, multi-file refactors, kickoff), **query the graph before
inventing architecture from memory**.

```bash
codegraph sync          # incremental refresh
codegraph index -f      # after large moves
codegraph query '…'     # symbols / explore / callers / node
```

- Prefer `codegraph` CLI (`query` / `explore` / `callers` / `node`) over blind `rg` sweeps.
- If MCP codegraph is inactive this session, still use the local index / CLI.
- Do not commit `.codegraph/` — local only.

